WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.800
- This is the year that
you've gone back out.

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.660
'Cause you went off for
two like years, right?

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:04.493
- [Garth Brooks] Yeah. So we...

00:00:04.493 --> 00:00:05.326
- 'Cause everybody did.

00:00:05.326 --> 00:00:08.250
- We did the comeback tour '14 through '18

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:10.560
and then started the stadium tour in '19

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:12.720
and then the pandemic shut us down twice.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:13.553
- [Kelly Clarkson] Yeah.

00:00:13.553 --> 00:00:15.990
- And people were very sweet,
but each time they came back

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:17.220
they came back in greater numbers

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:18.720
than they first were there so.

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:19.860
- [Clarkson] Yeah.
- It's so sweet.

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:24.000
I think what people love about
touring, that it's back now,

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.790
is I think people are
finally where they belong

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:27.985
and that's together again.

00:00:27.985 --> 00:00:28.818
- [Clarkson] Yeah.

00:00:28.818 --> 00:00:29.766
- So that makes me really happy.

00:00:29.766 --> 00:00:32.021
- Exactly. And it's so healing.

00:00:32.021 --> 00:00:34.200
So wait, so you and I have
done songs and stories before.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.033
- [Brooks] Yes, ma'am.

00:00:35.033 --> 00:00:37.050
- Which I loved and I heard
from fans, they loved it too.

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:40.560
So, it would be sad if we
didn't have a little like music.

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:41.816
Right? That would be weird, right?

00:00:41.816 --> 00:00:42.720
(audience clapping)

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:45.750
Yeah, so I just thought we
just put this out there.

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:46.710
- Oh sweet.

00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:47.637
Thank you very much.

00:00:47.637 --> 00:00:48.686
- We'll just...

00:00:48.686 --> 00:00:50.312
(audience cheers)

00:00:50.312 --> 00:00:51.511
We'll just lay it there.

00:00:51.511 --> 00:00:52.344
- [Brooks] Okay.

00:00:52.344 --> 00:00:55.473
- And if the spirit moves you, fine.

